# This repository shares its root with a general workspace.
# Track only the mobile approval project.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!REPORT.md
!LICENSE
!mobile-approval/
!mobile-approval/**

# Secrets and generated state stay out even after the project folder exists.
mobile-approval/node_modules/
mobile-approval/data/
mobile-approval/.env
mobile-approval/.env.*
mobile-approval/**/*.pem
mobile-approval/**/*.key
mobile-approval/**/*.crt
mobile-approval/**/vapid.json
mobile-approval/**/subscriptions.json
mobile-approval/**/token
